### Installation

{{ if eq .PackageManager "npm" }}
#### Using npm

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/{{ .Author }}/{{ .ProjectName }}.git
cd {{ .ProjectName }}

# Install dependencies
npm install

# Set up environment variables
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with your configuration

# Start development server
npm run dev
```

#### Using Docker

```bash
# Build the image
docker build -t {{ .ProjectName }} .

# Run the container
docker run -p {{ if .Analysis.Ports }}{{ index .Analysis.Ports 0 }}{{ else }}8080{{ end }}:{{ if .Analysis.Ports }}{{ index .Analysis.Ports 0 }}{{ else }}8080{{ end }} {{ .ProjectName }}
```

{{ else if eq .PackageManager "pip" }}
#### Using pip

```bash
